# interpose-sandbox agent rootfs — busybox init (PID 1).
# sysinit brings up the VM + starts the enforcer and the vsock guest-agent
# (see /sbin/interpose-boot). A serial getty is a debug fallback; the operator
# normally drives agents over vsock, not the console.
::sysinit:/sbin/interpose-boot
ttyAMA0::respawn:/bin/busybox getty -L -n -l /bin/sh 115200 ttyAMA0 vt100
ttyS0::respawn:/bin/busybox getty -L -n -l /bin/sh 115200 ttyS0 vt100
::ctrlaltdel:/bin/busybox reboot
::shutdown:/bin/busybox umount -a -r
